    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charlie is your average failing stand-up guy with a questionable repertoire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what can only be classified as mediocre humor on Earth seems to work wonders on some folks from Nebulon-28D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our hero is abducted by his newfound fans to be their representative for the 5100th Space Comedy Convention, and enter a contest where he needs to impress three alien judges by completing their absurd tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Charlie navigate through this fever dream in a classic Point-and-Click adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point-and-Click mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters with silly dialogues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun Puzzles with moderate moon logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dorky Tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Questionable Humor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds good?<br>Try the free demo now and get abducted!</p>",
